    "identifier": "dragon-slayer-thrust",
    "description": "<p>You charge a thrusting attack before lashing at with precise timing to deal a lethal blow to your enemy. You can move up to 10-feet towards the target and make a melee taijutsu Attack. On a hit, you deal your [Weapon damage] +3d6.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: On a hit, affected creature must make a Constitution saving throw, being Dazed on a failed save.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For every rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost by 3 and the damage by 1d6.</p>",
